{"id":4737,"date":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","date_gmt":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.com\/?page_id=4737"},"modified":"2026-06-04T18:40:37","modified_gmt":"2026-06-04T18:40:37","slug":"atlanta-corporate-event-dj","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/atlanta-corporate-event-dj\/","title":{"rendered":"Corporate\/Holiday Parties"},"content":{"rendered":"\n\n\t<h2>Atlanta Corporate Event DJ &amp; Company Party Entertainment<\/h2>\n<p>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs provides Atlanta corporate event DJ services for companies that want a polished, professional, and memorable event experience. From holiday parties and employee appreciation events to client celebrations, galas, grand openings, team building events, and corporate parties, our team helps create entertainment that reflects well on your company and keeps guests engaged.<\/p>\n<p>Your staff works hard, so your event should feel organized, fun, and worth attending. JAMMIN&#8217; DJs offers professional DJ entertainment, MC services, event lighting, music planning, and team building entertainment for corporate events across Atlanta, Georgia, Tennessee, Alabama, and surrounding areas.<\/p>\n<h3>Corporate Event Entertainment That Fits Your Company<\/h3>\n<p>Every company event has a different goal. Some events need high-energy dancing and celebration. Others need a professional MC, background music, awards support, team interaction, or a smooth flow from one part of the night to the next. Because of that, we start by listening to your vision before recommending the right entertainment package.<\/p>\n<p>Whether you are planning a holiday party, gala, awards banquet, company picnic, employee appreciation event, client appreciation party, grand opening, or team building activity, JAMMIN&#8217; DJs can help design an entertainment plan that fits your event style, timeline, venue, audience, and budget.<\/p>\n<h3>What to Expect From JAMMIN&#8217; DJs<\/h3>\n<p>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs starts by learning the goals for your event. Then, we help design a package that supports your schedule, guest count, venue layout, music preferences, and overall company culture. Once you choose JAMMIN&#8217; DJs, you receive access to complimentary online planning forms where you can organize your event details and timeline.<\/p>\n<p>These planning forms help your DJ and MC understand the flow of the event before arriving onsite. As a result, your announcements, introductions, awards, dinner, dancing, games, and special moments can move more smoothly.<\/p>\n<h3>Music Planning &amp; Guest Requests<\/h3>\n<p>Next, we tailor the music to your company and guests. You can use our online music request list to add songs to your must-play, play-if-possible, and do-not-play lists. This helps us match the music to your audience instead of relying on a generic playlist.<\/p>\n<p>If you want more guest involvement, we can also provide a guest request link that you can share with attendees before the event. This gives employees or guests a chance to feel involved while still allowing your DJ to guide the overall flow and energy of the night.<\/p>\n<h3>Planning Call, Setup &amp; Professional Execution<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>We hold a consultation call or meeting around the 30-day mark to review the planning forms with your assigned DJ.<\/li>\n<li>We confirm the timeline, music direction, announcements, special moments, and event expectations before the event date.<\/li>\n<li>Our team typically arrives about an hour and a half before the scheduled start time to set up equipment, run sound checks, and prepare the space.<\/li>\n<li>We use professional sound, lighting, and event equipment designed to look clean and support the tone of your event.<\/li>\n<li>Our team executes your event with professionalism, positive energy, and respect for your company, guests, and brand.<\/li>\n<li>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs team members dress in professional business attire unless the event theme calls for something different.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>Corporate Events We Support<\/h3>\n<p>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs can provide corporate entertainment for a wide range of company events. In addition, we can adjust the energy level based on whether your event is formal, casual, interactive, or celebration-focused.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Corporate holiday parties<\/li>\n<li>Employee appreciation events<\/li>\n<li>Client appreciation parties<\/li>\n<li>Grand openings<\/li>\n<li>Team building events<\/li>\n<li>Company picnics<\/li>\n<li>Awards banquets<\/li>\n<li>Galas and fundraisers<\/li>\n<li>Conference receptions<\/li>\n<li>Trade show parties<\/li>\n<li>Brand activations<\/li>\n<li>Networking events<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>DJ, MC, Lighting &amp; Team Building Options<\/h3>\n<p>For some events, music is only part of the experience. JAMMIN&#8217; DJs can also support your corporate party with MC services, event lighting, photo booth options, trivia, games, team building activities, and interactive entertainment.<\/p>\n<p>For example, lighting can help make the room feel more polished. A photo booth can give guests an easy activity during cocktail hour or downtime. Meanwhile, trivia and team building games can help employees interact in a way that feels natural and fun.<\/p>\n<h3>Helpful Corporate Event Planning Resource<\/h3>\n<p>If you are still shaping the event details, this <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cvent.com\/en\/blog\/events\/corporate-event-planning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">corporate event planning guide from Cvent<\/a> can help you think through goals, timelines, logistics, and attendee experience.<\/p>\n<h3>Some of Our Corporate Clients<\/h3>\n<p>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs has provided corporate entertainment for companies, organizations, brands, and events of many sizes. Browse a few of the corporate clients and organizations we have worked with below.<\/p>\n\n\t\t<style>\n\t\t\t#gallery-1 {\n\t\t\t\tmargin: auto;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-1 .gallery-item {\n\t\t\t\tfloat: left;\n\t\t\t